--- !u!114 &1107087514
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1107087510}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76f17372304b0d8468a04722381085c5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  HAS_ICON: 1
  TRANSFER_TO_THIS: 
  New_player_cords: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  FADE: {fileID: 0}
  DisplayText_on_fade: THE TEST OF COURAGE HAS BEGUN!!
  npcID: Jack
  message:
  - (Walking up the road you notice 2 men standing near a sign)
  - (One of them, a giant man with a fine suit, and a armband with a cross on it)
  - (The other a shorter, skinnier man wearing an officers uniform, wielding a giant
    flag depicting the union jack)
  - 'Jack: Well now... and who exactly are you supposed to be?'
  - 'Werner: Leave him alone you dumpkorpf. Was ist wrong with ein young junge walking
    around?'
  - 'Jack: Oh come on now Werner, the kid is litererally looking at me'
  - 'Jack: Rather intimidating now that i get a proper look at them... I mean the
    kid''s silent Werner, and they''re just begging for a beatdown'
  - 'Werner: You really feel ze need for beating up ein Kind at a time like zis??'
  - 'Werner: Du bist wirklich ein hoffnungsloser Fall (You are truly a hopeless case)'
  - 'Jack: Come on then kid, show me what you''ve got'
  - 'Jack: Just know that you''re chicken if you turn around now'
  - 'Werner: I''m not taking part in your games Jack, i''m ztaying out of zhis'
  messageAfterBattle:
  - ...Damn it
  - "Well, I\u2019ll give you this... you hit harder than you look."
  - Seems I was wrong about you.
  - "You\u2019re still young, still reckless, and still far too quiet for my liking..."
  - "but you\u2019ve got spine."
  - Not many can put me on the ground and still be standing after.
  - "Fine. You\u2019ve earned my respect."
  - "I\u2019ll join you... just don\u2019t expect me to go easy on you from here
    on out."
  enemies:
  - {fileID: 380776666666102203, guid: 81626ee011c04a14f830d81372cf7ea2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 0}
  partyReward: {fileID: 380776666666102203, guid: ef0b7b469a9018245b59bfd4c87a0d24, type: 3}
  secondPartyReward: {fileID: 380776666666102203, guid: 71fb71bfe1a2cc04eaea1d10fd66e980, type: 3}
  destroyAfterBattleDialogue: 1
  joinPartyWithoutBattle: 0
