  DisplayText_on_fade: THE FINAL HURDLE HAS BEGUN!!!
  npcID: Victor Taylor
  message:
  - ARHAHAHA WHO DARE COME CHALLENGE ME!!!
  - SOME PUNNY LITTLE HUMANS ARHAHA!!
  - COME AT ME THEN AAAAAARHHHHHHH!!!!!!!
  messageAfterBattle:
  - RAAWRRR
  - You were lucky this time.
  - But i was only one of many.
  - The further you go towards central london
  - The more evil, slaughter, fear and death you will find.
  - You will not last a minute against my superior.
  - 'And even if you are lucky. '
  - My master Malakith will annihilate you and your friends.
